---
// CampaignBookingCta.astro
---

<section class="py-20 bg-slate-950 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <svg class="h-full w-full" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="grid-pattern" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M0 40V0H40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#grid-pattern)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
      Don't wait for a notice.<br/>Know where you stand today.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Get your free books health check. No obligations, just a clear, actionable report in 48 hours.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#hero-form" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-tally-500 hover:bg-tally-600 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-tally-500/30">
        Book your free health check
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium">CA-led · NDA signed upfront · Free</p>
  </div>
</section>
